       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-TERASCALE-TENSOR-MESH-STRATEGY.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-TERA-TOPOLOGY.
           05  WS-NEURON-NODE-COUNT        PIC 9(15) VALUE 001099511627776.
           05  WS-SYNAPSE-EDGE-COUNT       PIC 9(18) VALUE 000070368744177664.
           05  WS-MOTZKIN-MOD-FIELD        PIC 9(15) VALUE 953467954114363.
           05  WS-STANAG-PACKET-THROUGHPUT PIC 9(15) VALUE 100000000000000.
       01  WS-TERA-MESH-PROOFS.
           05  WS-COTANGENT-BUNDLE-SYMPLEC PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-RIEMANNIAN-GEODESIC-OPT  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-LIOUVILLE-MEASURE-PRESRV PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-PONTREAGIN-MAXIMAL-MET   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TERA-MESH-PROOF-CODE     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-VERIFY-COTANGENT-BUNDLE.
           PERFORM 2000-VERIFY-RIEMANNIAN-GEODESIC.
           PERFORM 3000-VERIFY-LIOUVILLE-MEASURE.
           PERFORM 4000-VERIFY-PONTREAGIN-MAXIMAL.
           PERFORM 5000-SYNTHESIZE-PROOF.
           GOBACK.
       1000-VERIFY-COTANGENT-BUNDLE.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-COTANGENT-BUNDLE-SYMPLEC.
       2000-VERIFY-RIEMANNIAN-GEODESIC.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-RIEMANNIAN-GEODESIC-OPT.
       3000-VERIFY-LIOUVILLE-MEASURE.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-LIOUVILLE-MEASURE-PRESRV.
       4000-VERIFY-PONTREAGIN-MAXIMAL.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-PONTREAGIN-MAXIMAL-MET.
       5000-SYNTHESIZE-PROOF.
           IF WS-COTANGENT-BUNDLE-SYMPLEC = 1 AND
              WS-RIEMANNIAN-GEODESIC-OPT = 1 AND
              WS-LIOUVILLE-MEASURE-PRESRV = 1 AND
              WS-PONTREAGIN-MAXIMAL-MET = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TERA-MESH-PROOF-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TERA-MESH-PROOF-CODE.
